verb crawl_cooldown_timer_clears "Torch Slug crawls about after a chase is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 150
  take timer_crawl_cooldown
  unless phase_crawl_cooldown

verb crawl_chase_timer_clears "Torch Slug chases Link is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 290
  take timer_crawl_chase
  unless phase_crawl_chase

verb hurt_timer_clears "Torch Slug reels, flame out is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 430
